{
  "$schema": "./recordfiled-manifest.schema.json",
  "comment": [
    "Canonical manifest of RecordFiled(documents) events that must hydrate",
    "on every fresh runner (CI, new clone, ephemeral worker).",
    "",
    "Each entry is replayed by `scripts/migrate/replay-recordfiled-manifest.ts`,",
    "which is wired ONCE into `migrate:decisions-backfill` in package.json.",
    "",
    "When a new RecordFiled(documents) event needs to survive a fresh-runner",
    "replay, add an entry here — DO NOT write a new one-shot script + a new",
    "package.json line. That triple-line authoring pattern is what this",
    "manifest retires (D-RMS-RECORDFILED-MANIFEST).",
    "",
    "Schema:",
    "  recordId       — deterministic; replay is idempotent on this key.",
    "  sourcePath     — repo-relative path; body is read from disk at replay time.",
    "  asOf           — ISO timestamp; deterministic so event hash is stable.",
    "  registerKey    — RecordFiled register key (documents | briefs | ...).",
    "  classification — RecordFiled classification.",
    "  retention      — retention envelope { citationRef, minimumYears, archivalTier }.",
    "  actor          — { type, id }.",
    "  entity         — entity ID (defaults LE-ZA-HOZ-BANK if omitted).",
    "  metadata       — { title, path, category, author, date }; `path` is the",
    "                   logical Owner Inbox path used by recon (NOT sourcePath).",
    "  citations      — non-empty list of upstream urns / decision IDs.",
    "  supersedes     — optional prior recordId.",
    "  notes          — free-text; ignored at replay time."
  ],
